    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/apartment-33-block-a-smithfield-market-smithfield-dublin-d07-r927-1\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Apartment 33, Smithfield.\r\n\r\nApartment 33, located in the desirable Smithfield Market complex, presents a modern urban living experience. The property is part of a contemporary building characterised by its sleek architecture and well-maintained exterior. The surrounding area is pleasantly landscaped, offering manicured communal grounds, though individual gardens or driveways are not present in the complex setup.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the apartment, you are greeted by an inviting hallway leading through to a bright and spacious open-plan living area, ideal for both relaxation and entertaining. This room benefits from large windows that flood the space with natural light, enhancing the sense of space. The layout is flexible yet efficient, perfect for today’s modern lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is compact and functional, equipped with essential appliances, and opens onto the living space, allowing for ease of interaction. The two bedrooms, also of ample size, provide comfortable accommodations, with the master bedroom enjoying extra space for additional furniture or a potential workspace area.\r\n\r\nThe property features a single bathroom which includes quality fixtures and the added luxury of underfloor heating, essential for those chilly mornings. This feature highlights the thoughtful design and attention to detail throughout the apartment.\r\n\r\nSmithfield is a vibrant neighbourhood rich in amenities, including a variety of cafes, restaurants, and shops, all within a short walk. Excellent transport links are available, with the LUAS Smithfield stop a mere five-minute stroll away, offering swift travel across Dublin.\r\n\r\nOverall, this apartment is perfectly suited for first-time buyers or investors looking for a property with excellent rental potential, given its central location and modern conveniences. With its practical layout, appealing features, and prime location, Apartment 33 offers an attractive proposition for those seeking a dynamic and convenient lifestyle in the heart of Dublin."
      },
